      "id": "what-is-a-package-in-java",
      "heading": "What is a Package in Java?",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "A package in Java is a namespace that organizes a set of related classes and interfaces.",
            "It acts like a folder for your .java files, helping in grouping related components logically.",
            "Packages help: "
          ]
        },
